  "name": "Clawvisor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The Clawvisor Claude Cowork plugin allows users to connect apps like Gmail, Linear and Granola to Claude Cowork with task-based authorization. Approve a task once in the Clawvisor dashboard and each subsequent request will be checked for alignment with the approved task.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install clawvisor@claude-community` from `clawvisor/cowork-plugins`.\n\nOfficial Claude Code plugin marketplace for Clawvisor — a credential-vaulting gateway for AI agents.\n\nThe Clawvisor Claude Cowork plugin allows users to connect apps like Gmail, Linear and Granola to Claude Cowork with task-based authorization. Approve a task once in the Clawvisor dashboard and each subsequent request will be checked for alignment with the approved task.",
